 offers features like a web-based C2 dashboard, automated payload generation with digital signatures, and remote desktop capabilities. The malware has been distributed through various email campaigns, often alongside legitimate RMM tools. Proofpoint researchers identified links between TrustConnect's creator and previous users of Redline stealer. The emergence of this new MaaS demonstrates the ongoing evolution of the cybercrime market and the thriving ecosystem of RMM abuse.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-03-21T11:34:25.575000","created":"2026-02-19T11:10:29.994000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"","indicators":[{"id":4218417398,"indicator":"3a0dc172a2e7c42ae356de489d4ee73c","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-02-19T11:10:30","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4218417399,"indicator":"bb8d4ead5c3099424d2718a0feb286ad","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-02-19T11:10:30","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4218417400,"indicator":"1c94d0497214be31621ae825d88d29195617a109","type":"FileHash-SHA1","created":"2026-02-19T11:10:30","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4218417401,"indicator":"d8dc6c075e4efc9da65dfbd2f755a783a7455232","type":"FileHash-SHA1","created":"2026-02-19T11:10:30","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4218417402,"indicator":"162c0d3e671ddf4f7f3ae5681da5272111eab6588bc53843cc604fc386634594","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-02-19T11:10:30","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4218417403,"indicator":"cee6895f7df01da489c10bf5b83770ceede79ed4e1c8c4f8ea9787a4d035c79b","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-02-19T11:10:30","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4218417404,"indicator":"cf8